**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
# Exclude tsbuildinfo files: tsc -b (incremental TypeScript) reads these files to
# determine if a project is already built. If a stale .tsbuildinfo is copied from
# the host into the container, tsc will see an up-to-date project and emit nothing,
# while the excluded dist/ directory does not exist in the image. This causes the
# later COPY --from=api-builder to fail. Excluding these here forces a clean build.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
